# Markdown filenames

- Give new Markdown documents the `.markdown` extension.
- Use `.md` only when a tool or platform requires an exact conventional filename, such as
  `AGENTS.md` or `CLAUDE.md`.
- When renaming an existing document, update every code, documentation, and workflow reference
  in the same change.
